sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SRE as SRE / On-Call Engineer
    participant UI as NEXUS Web UI
    participant API as FastAPI Incident Route
    participant Supervisor as LangGraph Engine
    participant Planner as 1. Planner Node
    participant Collector as 2. Evidence Collector Node
    participant LogAnalyzer as 3. Log Analyzer Node
    participant HypoGen as 4. Hypothesis Generator Node
    participant HypoEval as 5. Hypothesis Evaluator Node
    participant Impact as 6. Impact Analyzer Node
    participant RecEngine as 7. Recommendation Engine Node
    participant SummaryGen as 8. Summary Generator Node
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Store
    participant Bus as Alert / Event Bus

    SRE->>UI: Click "Trigger AI Investigation" on Incident
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/workspaces/{wid}/incidents/{id}/investigations
    API->>DB: Verify Workspace RBAC & Create Investigation Record (status: running)
    API->>Supervisor: Initialize InvestigationState Graph

    rect rgb(18, 22, 34)
        note over Supervisor,Planner: Stage 1: Investigation Planning
        Supervisor->>Planner: Execute planner_node(state)
        Planner->>Planner: Determine Scope, Focus Areas & Time Window from Severity
        Planner-->>Supervisor: Update state.plan
    end

    rect rgb(20, 24, 38)
        note over Supervisor,Collector: Stage 2: Evidence Gathering
        Supervisor->>Collector: Execute collector_node(state)
        Collector->>DB: Query Service Metadata, Dependencies, Logs & Timeline Events
        DB-->>Collector: Return Service Topology, Telemetry Records & Incident History
        Collector-->>Supervisor: Update state.evidence
    end

    rect rgb(24, 28, 44)
        note over Supervisor,LogAnalyzer: Stage 3: Log Pattern Analysis
        Supervisor->>LogAnalyzer: Execute log_analyzer_node(state)
        LogAnalyzer->>LogAnalyzer: Cluster Error Signatures, Correlate Trace IDs & Detect Spikes
        LogAnalyzer-->>Supervisor: Update state.log_analysis
    end

    rect rgb(28, 32, 50)
        note over Supervisor,HypoGen: Stage 4: Hypothesis Generation
        Supervisor->>HypoGen: Execute hypothesis_generator_node(state, llm_client)
        HypoGen->>HypoGen: Generate Ranked Hypotheses via LLM (Ollama/OpenAI) or Analytical Engine
        HypoGen-->>Supervisor: Update state.hypotheses
    end

    rect rgb(32, 36, 56)
        note over Supervisor,HypoEval: Stage 5: Hypothesis Evaluation & Scoring
        Supervisor->>HypoEval: Execute hypothesis_evaluator_node(state)
        HypoEval->>HypoEval: Score Evidence Corroboration, Identify Primary Root Cause & Confidence
        HypoEval-->>Supervisor: Update state.hypotheses with Confidence Scores
    end

    rect rgb(36, 40, 62)
        note over Supervisor,Impact: Stage 6: Blast Radius & Impact Analysis
        Supervisor->>Impact: Execute impact_analyzer_node(state)
        Impact->>Impact: Traverse Dependency Tiers & Concurrent Incidents
        Impact-->>Supervisor: Update state.impact (Blast Radius & Affected Services)
    end

    rect rgb(40, 44, 68)
        note over Supervisor,RecEngine: Stage 7: Recommendation Formulation
        Supervisor->>RecEngine: Execute recommendation_engine_node(state)
        RecEngine->>RecEngine: Draft Prioritized Actions (P1 Mitigation, P2 Diagnostic, P3 Prevention)
        RecEngine-->>Supervisor: Update state.recommendations
    end

    rect rgb(44, 48, 74)
        note over Supervisor,SummaryGen: Stage 8: Executive Summary Compilation
        Supervisor->>SummaryGen: Execute summary_generator_node(state)
        SummaryGen->>SummaryGen: Synthesize Executive Report with Root Cause & Runbook Actions
        SummaryGen-->>Supervisor: Update state.summary
    end

    Supervisor->>DB: Persist Completed Investigation, Findings & Recommendations
    Supervisor->>Bus: Publish IncidentInvestigationCompleted Event
    Bus-->>UI: Real-Time Notification Update
    UI-->>SRE: Display 8-Stage Investigation Report & Actionable Remediations
